1
00:00:06,522 --> 00:00:10,122
(Penny:)This is the best. You have booze with
breakfast on Tuesday, you got a problem.

2
00:00:10,359 --> 00:00:12,689
(Penny:)You do it on the weekend,
you got brunch.

3
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:14,859
(Amy:)Sheldon doesn't believe in brunch.

4
00:00:15,064 --> 00:00:19,624
Can't stand a table where one person's having
an omelet and another is having a sandwich.

5
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:22,993
That's not exhausting at all.

6
00:00:25,908 --> 00:00:26,968
(Leonard:)Oh.

7
00:00:27,143 --> 00:00:31,633
(Penny(receiving text):)It's Leonard. He says they're on the road
and headed for Bakersfield at warp speed.

8
00:00:32,148 --> 00:00:35,138
(Penny(receiving text):)Maybe it's the mimosa,
but I'm gonna give the kid an LOL.

9
00:00:37,153 --> 00:00:38,453
(Bernadette:)Cute how excited they are.

10
00:00:38,654 --> 00:00:41,384
(Bernadette:)You should have seen Howard
sewing his costume all week.

11
00:00:41,924 --> 00:00:43,324
(Amy:)When did Howard learn to sew?

12
00:00:43,559 --> 00:00:47,619
When he was a little boy, every couple of
months he'd have to let his mom's pants out.

13
00:00:50,866 --> 00:00:53,266
I don't understand
why they go to these conventions.

14
00:00:53,469 --> 00:00:56,559
(Penny:)The four of them work at a major university,
they're all smart...

15
00:00:56,772 --> 00:00:59,142
...how can they be into something
for 12-year-olds?

16
00:00:59,341 --> 00:01:03,141
(Bernadette:)I don't mind it. I think Howie's
just in touch with his inner child.

